{"id":"00191","root":"uni00191_1","name":{"ja":"鬼崎　きらら","en":"Onisaki Kirara"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"鬼崎　きらら","en":"Onisaki Kirara"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Oni","Taimanin"],"release":"2019-05-17","limited":false,"characterId":150,"profile":{"ja":"五車学園の先輩。鬼族と人間のハーフで、霜の鬼神と呼ばれた高位鬼族の母から冷気を操る力を、対魔忍の父から忍法を受け継いだハイブリッド対魔忍。母親譲りの冷気を操る力は強力で、一瞬で空気中の水分を凍結させて氷の盾を作ったり、冷気を纏った拳で敵を凍結させたりすることもできる。しかし父との確執から忍法の使用は封じており、彼女がどんな忍法を使うのか知る者はいなかった。鬼族の特徴である角が頭の横に生えているが、幼い時からのコンプレックスであるため、普段は大きなリボンともさもさのツインテールで隠している。基本的に男嫌いで、男は全員ケダモノだと思っている。","en":"(Onisaki Kirara, she/her) She is a senior at Gosha Academy. As a half-demon, half-human, she inherited frost manipulation from her mother—a high-rank demon once called the Frost Demon God—and ninjutsu from her Taimanin father, making her a hybrid Taimanin. Her mother's icy power is formidable, capable of instantly freezing moisture in the air to form ice shields or encasing enemies in frost with chilled punches. However, a rift with her father has sealed away her ninjutsu, so no one knows what techniques she might use. Demon horns sprout from the sides of her head, a source of lifelong insecurity, so she hides them beneath a large ribbon and tangled twin-tails. She generally despises men, regarding all of them as beasts."},"illustrator":"葵渚","voiceActor":"白瀬ほなみ","forms":[{"id":"uni00191_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1140,2280],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[189,378],"def":[125,250],"spd":[62,62],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["1","190004"]},{"id":"uni00191_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1680,3360],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[303,606],"def":[175,350],"spd":[62,62],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["1","190004","190005"]},{"id":"uni00191_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2220,4437],"sp":[300,300],"atk":[417,835],"def":[225,450],"spd":[62,62],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["1","190004","1900